PHASE 9 — RISK MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
=============================================================================

9.1 POSITION SIZING CALCULATOR
- Fixed risk % model: position size = (equity × risk%) / (entry - stop loss).
- Kelly Criterion model.
- Fixed lot model.
- Volatility-adjusted model (position size inversely proportional to ATR).
- Account for pip value differences across currency pairs and instruments.

9.2 PORTFOLIO RISK CONTROLS
- Max open trades: configurable limit.
- Max risk per trade: configurable %.
- Max total portfolio risk: configurable % of equity.
- Max drawdown limit: configurable %; when hit, halt all new entries and
  alert user.
- Correlated pair limit: detect when user is over-exposed to a single
  currency and warn/block new entries.
- Daily loss limit: stops all trading for the day when reached.
- News event lock: automatically block new entries during configurable
  window around high-impact events.

9.3 MARGIN MONITOR
- Real-time margin level calculation per broker.
- Alert at configurable margin level thresholds (e.g. 200%, 150%, 120%).
- Emergency close protocol: if margin level drops below configurable
  floor, automatically close least-profitable positions to free margin.

