14.1 CLOUD FUNCTIONS:

  calendar-sync-worker:
  - Runs on Cloud Scheduler every 15 minutes.
  - Fetches ForexFactory XML calendar, Investing.com calendar, FXStreet
    calendar. Normalizes, deduplicates, and writes to Firestore.
  - Triggers FCM push to all subscribed users when new high-impact event
    detected or actual value released.

  price-alert-worker:
  - Subscribes to Polygon.io WebSocket on server.
  - Evaluates all user-defined price alerts stored in Firestore.
  - Sends FCM push notification when alert condition triggers.
  - Scales horizontally via Cloud Run.

  news-ingestion-worker:
  - Polls all RSS feeds every 5 minutes.
  - Performs server-side sentiment analysis using a Python NLP model (FinBERT).
  - Stores enriched news in Firestore. Broadcasts to subscribed clients
    via Firebase Realtime Database for near-real-time delivery.

  llm-proxy-worker:
  - Secures all LLM API calls server-side (keys never in client app).
  - Implements rate limiting per user per tier.
  - Logs all LLM usage to Firestore for cost tracking.
  - Streams responses back to iOS client via HTTP chunked transfer encoding.

  backtest-worker:
  - Accepts backtest configuration from client.
  - Runs compute-heavy backtests server-side using Python (Backtrader or
    VectorBT) for strategies that exceed device capability.
  - Returns results as JSON, stored in Firestore + Firebase Storage.

  report-generation-worker:
  - Server-side PDF generation using Python (ReportLab or WeasyPrint)
    for complex multi-page reports.
  - Stores generated PDFs in Firebase Storage and returns signed URL.

  risk-monitor-worker:
  - Polls broker position data for all users with active automated trading.
  - Enforces server-side risk rules as a safety backstop.
  - Closes positions and sends emergency alerts if client-side risk engine
    fails to respond.

  cot-parser-worker:
  - Downloads CFTC COT reports every Friday after 3:30 PM ET.
  - Parses CSV. Stores structured data in Firestore.
  - Computes net positioning changes. Triggers analysis agent update.

